# Our own source keeps LF in the repository and in the working tree, so behavior does not depend on
# which machine checked it out.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The supplied content package is byte-addressed: `learning-release.json` carries a SHA-256 for every
# lesson, lab and the activity file, and the importer verifies them. Any line-ending conversion here
# changes those bytes and breaks every hash. Leave this directory untouched.
VS_Code_App_and_First_Five_Lessons_v1/** -text

*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
